ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120408352072_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120408352072_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-12/6a7b770c3baaanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">恭喜！C罗社媒宣布与乔治娜结婚，晒两人戴婚戒照：C❤️G</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.57" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120325108263.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.57" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.57" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120325108263_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120325108263_720.jpg"> </div><p>C罗确认已和乔治娜结婚，他在社媒晒与乔治娜戴婚戒照，配文：C❤️G。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-12/6a7b77a9ef114native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">礼成！邮报：C罗和乔治娜在葡萄牙低调举行婚礼，已正式结为夫妻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/6a7b7a1426f0f_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/6a7b7a1426f0f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/6a7b7a1426f0f.jpg"> </div><p>据《每日邮报》报道，C罗和乔治娜已经在葡萄牙当地举行了结婚典礼。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-12/6a7b52000aa2enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">穆帅纪录片透露卡西曾因马德里堵车要求推迟训练，直言球员被宠坏</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.45" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200219/5e4d53d765c93.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.45" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.45" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200219/5e4d53d765c93.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200219/5e4d53d765c93.jpg"> </div><p>穆里尼奥在纪录片中回顾了自己的执教生涯，他在片中透露了自己和时任皇马队长卡西利亚斯的接触。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-12/6a7b749a8781cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">训练也伤！罗马诺：摩纳哥通知33岁博格巴团队，想夏窗结束前解约</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120316204927_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120316204927_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120316204927_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺报道，摩纳哥已经向博格巴提出了终止合同的提议。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-12/6a7b9de604ed5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">荷媒：荷兰足协总监和马丁内斯会谈，有意邀请他执教荷兰国家队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240706/66887612c4a84.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240706/66887612c4a84.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240706/66887612c4a84.jpg"> </div><p>据荷兰媒体telegraaf报道，荷兰足协正在和罗伯特·马丁内斯会谈，有意邀请他执教荷兰国家队。</p><p><strong>【转会新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-12/6a7b6e66a40canative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：37岁桑切斯加盟美职联球队蒙特利尔，签约1+1年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120248159684.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120248159684_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120248159684_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，阿莱克西斯·桑切斯加盟美职联球队蒙特利尔，签约1+1年。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-12/6a7b4d04bc379native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：30岁曼城中场菲利普斯外租至英冠谢菲尔德联，租期一个赛季</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120026013364_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120026013364_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120026013364_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，曼城中场菲利普斯租借加盟谢菲联。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-12/6a7b98d5d3c1anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">很快HWG！罗马诺：费兰明日缺席巴萨训练，转会巴黎进入最后阶段</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.77" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120551003579.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.77" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.77" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120551003579_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260812/202608120551003579_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺报道，费兰·托雷斯明日预计不会出现在巴萨的训练中，他转会巴黎的交易即将得到“HWG”确认。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7b367844e17native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">没兴趣！泰晤士报：曼联1月被告知斯凯利要6000万镑，认为太高</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608112252598266.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608112252598266_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608112252598266_720.jpg"> </div><p>英媒《泰晤士报》报道，切尔西已通过中间人得知了斯凯利的转会可能性，阿森纳面临是否出售球员的难题，而曼联对球员没有兴趣。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7b3dd20cab7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">天空体育：切尔西再次询价斯凯利，阿森纳不希望将他卖给同城死敌</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250202/679ed9ef747ad.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data